text
Entrance Hall
The heart of the house: a cold marble floor, a dead fireplace under a wide mantel, and a tall case clock standing silent against the stairs. Doors lead west to the study and east to the kitchen; a colder passage runs north.

You can see a grey overcoat and Mrs Kettle here.

On the mantel you see a framed photograph.
end text

